[00:13.66]1. Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn,
[00:19.06]God’s duly appointed King.
[00:19.98]He reigns for truth and justice;
[00:19.98]Rich blessings his rule will bring.
[00:19.98]With dignity and splendor
[00:20.24]And love for God’s great name,
[00:24.66]He’ll vindicate Jehovah,
[00:24.66]His sov’reignty proclaim.
[00:25.02](Chorus)
[00:25.90]Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn!
[00:29.32]All praise God’s anointed Son.
[00:35.76]Installed upon Mount Zion,
[00:37.22]His Kingship has now begun!
[01:29.68]2. Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn,
[01:33.58]Who died so that we may live.
[01:38.36]He humbly paid the ransom;
[01:42.98]Our sins God can now forgive.
[01:48.20]The bride of Christ awaits him,
[01:52.68]Adorned for him in white.
[01:57.46]This marriage in the heavens
[02:02.98]Will prove God’s rule is right.
[02:08.04](Chorus)
[02:11.22]Praise Jehovah’s Firstborn!
[02:14.92]All praise God’s anointed Son.
[02:20.16]Installed upon Mount Zion,
[02:24.32]His Kingship has now begun!
